# EdgeVerify — Windsurf Rules

## Project Overview

EdgeVerify is a serverless web app on **Cloudflare Pages + Pages Functions**.
It shows visitors real-time connection info: IP address, ISP, VPN/proxy detection, TLS details, and geolocation.
The backend is stateless — no database, no logging, no user data persistence.

## Architecture

```
Browser
  │
  ├── GET /          → Cloudflare Pages serves index.html (static)
  └── GET /api/info  → Cloudflare Pages Functions runs functions/api/info.js
                           │
                           └── fetch → ip-api.com (reverse DNS, ISP, proxy flag)
```

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Hosting | Cloudflare Pages |
| Backend | Cloudflare Pages Functions (ES Modules) |
| Runtime | Cloudflare Workers (V8-based, not Node.js) |
| Frontend | HTML + Tailwind CSS CDN + Vanilla JS |
| External | ip-api.com |

## Coding Standards

### Backend (`functions/api/info.js`)

- Export pattern: `export async function onRequest(context)`
- Always guard `request.cf`: `const cf = request.cf || {}`
  — `request.cf` is `{}` in local development (wrangler pages dev)
- Use `fetch()` (Workers Fetch API) for external HTTP calls
- Catch all external API errors; set fallback values; always return HTTP 200
- Required response headers:
  ```
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate, proxy-revalidate
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  ```

### Frontend (`index.html`)

- Vanilla JS only — no React, Vue, Svelte, or other frameworks
- Tailwind CSS via CDN only — no build pipeline
- Use `textContent` (not `innerHTML`) when rendering API data to DOM
- Fetch `/api/info` on page load, merge with browser-side data, then render

## Constraints

| Constraint | Details |
|-----------|---------|
| ip-api.com protocol | HTTP only (free tier does not support HTTPS) |
| ip-api.com rate limit | 45 requests/minute — handle HTTP 429 with fallback |
| `cf.isTor` | Unofficial property — treat absence as `false` |
| `cf.botManagement.score` | Requires Cloudflare paid plan — show `"N/A"` on free tier |
| WebRTC local IP | Modern browsers return mDNA UUID — show user-friendly message |

## Security Non-Negotiables

1. Never persist user IP or connection data (no DB, no external log service)
2. All API responses must include `Cache-Control: no-store`
3. DOM rendering must use `textContent` to prevent XSS

